  "title": "Scalloped Potatoes and Ham",
  "description": "Hearty scalloped potatoes and ham smothered in a thick Cheddar cheese sauce is an easy, comforting main or side dish recipe, perfect for holidays.",
  "authors": [
    "Lumielle"
  ],
